---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactForm from '../../components/ContactForm.astro';
import '../../styles/pandemonic.css';
---

<BaseLayout title="Destined For Dirt Productions">
  <img class="image" src="/pandemonic/buphomet.png" />
  <img class="logo" src="/pandemonic/pandemonic.png" />

  <div class="container">
    <div class="p-text">MEDITATIONS ON OKLAHOMA MISERY</div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="p-text">COMING</div>
    <div class="p-text">4/21/2023</div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <br />
    <iframe
      id="audio"
      frameborder="0"
      height="100%"
      width="120px"
      src="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1n2NkhgVTF4TNCwoN4ME3QNJIceopOD8_/preview?usp=sharing"
    ></iframe>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="text">ABOUT</div>
    <div class="p-text">
      PANDEMONIC IS A THREE-PIECE INSTRUMENTAL DOOM BAND FROM OKLAHOMA. SINCE AT LEAST 2019, THEY'VE BEEN WORKING ON THE SAME FUCKING RECORD.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="text">NEWS</div>
    <div class="p-text">SHIT'S ROUGH OUT THERE.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="text">STORE</div>
    <div class="p-text">
      I DUNNO, DONATE TO PLANNED PARENTHOOD OR SOMETHING. PROVE IT TO US, WE MIGHT MAKE YOU A TAPE.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="text">TOUR</div>
    <div class="p-text">LOL, YEAH RIGHT.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="p-text">
      <a class="p-text" href="mailto:destinedfordirt@gmail.com">SEND HATE MAIL TO DESTINEDFORDIRT ( AT ) GMAIL ( DOT ) COM</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="text">CONTACT</div>
    <ContactForm
      accessKey="93c4421c-dc53-4965-be2c-fe2a3beffc87"
      subject="Pandemonic Contact"
      redirectUrl="https://www.destinedfordirt.com/pandemonic/?success=true"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="container coming-text">
    <div class="text">DFD-001</div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
